Package: cudaBio
Type: Package
Title: GPU Principal Component Analysis via the rcupp Framework
Version: 0.0.0.9006
Authors@R: person("Joe", "Zhu", email = "sha.joe.zhu@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Joe Zhu [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Joe Zhu <sha.joe.zhu@gmail.com>
Description: A minimal downstream example of the 'rcupp' CUDA-for-Rcpp
    framework. Computes principal components by power iteration using rcupp's
    fixed GPU operators, reached through LinkingTo: rcupp and
    R_GetCCallable(). It contains no CUDA code and no CUDA build logic of its
    own, and works identically whether rcupp was built with a CUDA backend or
    its CPU fallback. Intended as a template for bioinformatics p>>n
    workloads (PCA / GWAS).
License: Apache License 2.0
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
Imports: rcupp, Rcpp
LinkingTo: rcupp, Rcpp
NeedsCompilation: yes
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown
Remotes: shajoezhu/rcupp
VignetteBuilder: knitr
